 placement of standards, ledgers, transoms, couplers, and toe-boards.\n-> Dual Learning Modes: Build foundational knowledge in an interactive Practice Mode, then validate skills under pressure in Test Mode.\n->Performance Analytics: Track execution times and procedural accuracy instantly to measure trainee readiness.\n\nEquip your team with the muscle memory and confidence required to identify critical structural defects before they ever step onto a real job site.", "short_description": "Master tower scaffolding erection with zero risk. The AryaXR Scaffolding Training Simulator offers a safe VR environment to learn critical, high-risk procedures. Build your foundational knowledge in Practice Mode, and then put your skills to the test in Test Mode to gain real-world confidence."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aryaxr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ARYAXR AI SOLUTIONS (OPC) PRIVATE LIMITED", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://aryaxr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1169955376206886"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1004911969179967"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1004911969179967"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1784306640, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "100